Package: MokkenLab
Title: Mokken Scale Analysis Lab for Nonparametric Item Response Theory
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Arquímedes De León", "Chacón Chacón", email = "arquimedeschacon@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(affiliation = "Universidad Católica Andrés Bello (UCAB), Caracas, Venezuela"))
Description: A jamovi module that exposes every capability of the mokken
    package (scalability coefficients with standard errors and confidence
    intervals, significance tests, automated item selection, checks of
    monotonicity, invariant item ordering, nonintersection and conditional
    association, reliability, Guttman-error outliers, norm statistics and
    two-level Mokken scale analysis) and pairs every result with
    evidence-based methodological guidance, plain-language interpretation and
    educational support.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports:
    jmvcore,
    R6,
    mokken (>= 3.1.2),
    poLCA,
    ggplot2,
    grDevices,
    grid,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    withr
Encoding: UTF-8
